    "title": "Inference architecture (0.56)",
    "role": "reference",
    "authority": "markdown_source"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b000001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# Inference architecture (0.56)\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Inference architecture (0.56)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "The public Service schedules model/catalog operations and generation through\nbounded native worker queues. ModelManager owns runtime/model loading; residency\nand context caches remain below the service. llama.cpp/libmtmd implement native\ntext and media inference; the explicitly selected MLX adapter retains its Python\nworker. Hardware/resource discovery and native media budgets remain here.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 12,
      "raw": "IPC and HTTP expose inference and a generic RpcHandler extension interface.\nThey neither construct an agent nor link iiDecision. Agent ownership, tools,\nsessions, MCP, hooks, routing and decision policy belong to iiMultimodalAgent.\nServiceModel in that module adapts this Service without a reverse dependency.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 13,
      "end_line": 13,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 14,
      "end_line": 17,
      "raw": "Public contracts remain C++23 and the existing Qt Core/Network API. This module\nextraction does not claim Qt removal. File creation retains iiFileProvider's\nnative/compatibility contracts. Installed inference consumers verify that neither\nagent nor iiDecision targets are imported by find_package(iiLocalLLM).\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000008",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 18,
      "end_line": 18,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 19,
      "end_line": 20,
      "raw": "See [module extraction](ModuleExtraction.md), [inference model management](ModelManagement.md),\n[HTTP](HTTP.md), [IPC](IPC.md), and the [agent migration](../../iiMultimodalAgent/docs/Migration.md).\n"
    }
  ],
